From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 21:06:53 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] msado15: Properties collections, recordset
 Requery/Resync/Save/Supports/chunks/original values, Execute, connection
 points, Command Execute/Refresh (3203)

Gap-A batch for msado15 (59 items; wsg/patches/notes/3203.txt, g/dec/42_msado15.py).
New properties.c (Properties and Property collections for Connection, Command, Parameter, Recordset,
Field); Requery, Resync, Source object, ActiveCommand, DataSource, Supports, Seek/Index errors,
field lists for AddNew/Update, CancelUpdate, OriginalValue/UnderlyingValue, AppendChunk/GetChunk,
Precision/NumericScale, Save as XML; Connection Execute/Cancel, connection point enumerators,
DSO/WrapDSOandSession; Command Execute/Cancel/CommandStream/OLEDBCommand, Parameters.Refresh;
Stream Open on IStream objects, Cancel.

Gate fastado2 (cscript). 10 mutants SG_MUTANT_ADO2_* shown caught (SUPPORTS FIELDLIST ORIGINAL
CANCEL CHUNK SEEK NULLS REQUERY PRECISION PROPCOUNT). msado15 test 64/32: 0 failures, as stock.
Escalated: OpenSchema, UpdateBatch, CancelBatch (ESCALATE.md).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
